    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Transform Energy and Matter</p></blockquote><p>You study spells that modify energy and matter; to you, the world is eminently mutable. With your magic, you become a smith at reality's forge. Some Transmuters are tinkerers and pranksters, while others seek the power to make and unmake worlds.</p><h3>Transmuter Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.JyQ8PPXx3vOVUYyQ]{Transmutation Savant}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.gftOfV7i9Irjtgde]{Transmuter's Stone}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.94PSwwbbeTYp2KpO]{Wondrous Alteration}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.ekFrCG58uF56Vs8D]{Empowered Transmutation}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.nhjiHVW5vXGdPLDk]{Potent Stone}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.D6Ola68LYTeXFlVa]{Shape-Shifter}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.8LUP4qwPNAPK8JJd]{Master Transmuter}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
